  ["Low-code builder in your SAP system", "A vendor's designer, installed as an add-on or a transport: screens are clicked together, stored in the vendor's tables and built into UI5 apps by its runtime. Licensed per user, device or developer. Several vendors sell one."],
  ["Low-code platform beside SAP", "A server or cloud tenant of its own, reaching SAP over connectors; built for citizen developers, SAP is one of many backends. General-purpose platforms and SAP's own no-code builder belong here."],
];
const compare = [
  ["License cost", "None: MIT, for any number of users, systems and apps", "Part of the SAP license", "Part of the SAP license", "Subscription per user, device or developer, monthly or yearly, often with a minimum term and a setup fee", "Subscription per user or app, plus the tenant"],
  ["Who builds the apps", "The ABAP team you already have", "ABAP plus CDS, RAP and annotation skills", "JavaScript / UI5 developers", "The ABAP team, in the vendor's designer, after its training", "Citizen developers, or developers trained on the platform"],
