  ["Where the business logic lives", "In ABAP, next to the data, as it does today", "In ABAP, behind CDS and annotations", "Split: JavaScript in the browser, a service in ABAP", "In ABAP classes bound to the designer's views; the screen in the vendor's tables", "On the platform; SAP is reached over connectors"],
